pages.content:
PHP supports increment (++) operation on characters as well, but only for incrementing. PHP allows you to increment a character to its next value in the ASCII sequence, but decrementing (--) on characters is not supported.

```php
$ch = 'r';
$ch++;
echo $ch . PHP_EOL;
```
This will output:
```php
s
```
